    "**Depend on** (depender de): **It depends on the weather**. **Listen to** (escuchar): **Listen to music**. **Wait for** (esperar a): **I'll wait for you**. **Think about** (pensar en): **I think about you**. **Agree with** (estar de acuerdo con): **I agree with you**. **Apologise for** (disculparse por): **I apologise for the noise**."
